/* 8个新区域补充探索瞬间 8 × 5段 = 40段（无纯菜单Hub、1段1瞬间、双检定） */
:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
栈桥第四根石柱下的潮水坑里困着一只带铜环的信天翁，翅羽被废弃鱼线缠在牡蛎壳上。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔岛 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="reg-mom-foghorn-1">
<<investigateicon>><<link "用小刀割断缠绕鱼线 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-foghorn-1">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
	信天翁振翅飞向海雾，脚环铜管里掉出一枚旧港银币。<span class="green">你解救了受困的海鸟。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_foghorn_1")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺通道继续往里探看 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	信天翁受惊啄了你的手背一下，浪花也打湿了裤脚。<span class="red">手背被鸟喙啄出一道红印。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦干手心汗水再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回外围通道歇脚 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "按住海鸟双翼解开脚环死结 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-foghorn-1">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
		你一手轻柔地按住信天翁淋湿的双翼，一手用指甲尖挑开脚环铜管上的海藻死结。<span class="green">死结应声松脱，脚环铜管里滑出一枚旧港古铜徽章。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_foghorn_1")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺通道继续往里探看 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
		信天翁不安地扑扇了一下翅膀，咸冷海水甩了你满脸，死结反而勒得更紧。<span class="red">你忙松开手退后半步，等海鸟安静下来再试。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[看准卡槽位置再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起随身工具退回前段 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
守塔人石屋外的蓄水石槽被海风刮来的海带堵住了滤网，溢出的雨水正往木门缝里渗。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔岛 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="reg-mom-foghorn-2">
<<investigateicon>><<link "伸手清走滤网上的墨绿海带 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-foghorn-2">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	积水顺着暗槽排入大海，你在滤网底摸到一枚遗落的黄铜袖扣。<span class="green">石屋蓄水槽恢复了通畅。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_foghorn_2")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺通道继续往里探看 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	冰凉雨水顺着袖口倒灌进来，冻得你小臂发麻。<span class="red">冷水灌入袖口令人打颤。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[放轻手腕力道再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[拍净衣袖退回安全处 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "拔开石槽侧面的备用排水塞 (0:10)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-foghorn-2">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
		你摸到石槽外壁的水草下有一枚备用木塞，用力拔出后积水打着旋排空。<span class="green">混着铜币的淤泥顺势留在了槽底凹坑里。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_foghorn_2")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺通道继续往里探看 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	备用木塞被海盐浸得发胀，你扳动时脚下一滑差点踩进水洼。<span class="red">咸涩雨水溅湿裤管，木塞仍卡在孔里。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[垫稳脚下重心再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起随身工具退回前段 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
断桅沉船滩的肋木夹缝间，一只密封的朗姆酒木桶随退潮搁浅，桶箍铁皮已经锈断了一根。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔岛 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="reg-mom-foghorn-3">
<<investigateicon>><<link "用撬棍撬开松动的橡木桶盖 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-foghorn-3">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11500 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	空木桶内胆里藏着一只防潮油布袋，装着几枚老银币。<span class="green">你打开了搁浅的夹层木桶。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_foghorn_3")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺通道继续往里探看 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	生锈的铁桶箍崩开划破了你的手指。<span class="red">铁箍弹开刮伤了你的指尖。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[凑近微光看清再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[拍净衣袖退回安全处 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "从木塞缝隙倒出封存物件 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-foghorn-3">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
		你拔松朗姆酒木桶侧面的软木塞，顺着缝隙将桶内封存的防潮油布卷一点点倒了出来。<span class="green">油布卷里裹着早年水手留下的几枚古古铜徽章。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_foghorn_3")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺通道继续往里探看 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
		软木塞被海盐泡得发胀，你用力扳动时木屑崩进指缝，木塞仍卡在桶口。<span class="red">指尖隐隐作痛，你只得先记下木桶位置。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺着纹理方向再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺着石阶退回入口处 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
海蚀回音廊的石壁风孔在涨潮前发出尖锐哨音，一块松动的盐晶石正卡在主风道口。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔岛 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="reg-mom-foghorn-4">
<<investigateicon>><<link "用长柄铁钩敲落卡住的盐晶 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-foghorn-4">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 250>>
	盐晶落下后风孔重归低沉共鸣，里面还裹着一枚古铜币。<span class="green">回音廊的风鸣恢复了清越共鸣。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_foghorn_4")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺通道继续往里探看 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	气流夹着细碎盐粒扑面打来，迷得你睁不开眼。<span class="red">盐粒迷眼让你连退两步。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[活动酸麻手指再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺着石阶退回入口处 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "屏息探手从风孔摸出异物 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-foghorn-4">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 430>>
		你算准两道海浪拍岸的间隙屏息探手，从回音壁风孔内侧摸出了一块包裹铜币的盐晶。<span class="green">风孔重归通畅，低沉醇厚的海鸣声在廊间回荡。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_foghorn_4")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺通道继续往里探看 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
		一股冷冽的穿堂海风突然从风孔倒灌而出，吹得你指尖发僵，差点擦破手背。<span class="red">你连忙缩回手腕缓了口气，避开迎面扑来的水雾。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[避开湿滑边角再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手退回岔路口 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
灯塔底层旋转扶梯下，一盏备用防风铜灯的玻璃罩裂了半道缝，里头的鲸油还没燃尽。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔岛 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="reg-mom-foghorn-5">
<<investigateicon>><<link "用耐热云母片补好灯罩裂口 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-foghorn-5">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	你在铜灯底座暗格里摸到了守塔人留下的应急零钱。<span class="green">备用防风铜灯被你妥善处置。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_foghorn_5")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺暗道继续深探 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 6]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	滚烫的玻璃罩边缘烫到了你的拇指。<span class="red">灯罩余温烫红了你的拇指。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[按住底座晃动再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手退回岔路口 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "将残余鲸油转装进随身壶 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-foghorn-5">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
		你取出随身小漏斗，将裂罩防风灯底座里尚未燃尽的精炼鲸油稳稳转装进备用油壶。<span class="green">倒空鲸油的灯座暗格里露出了一小卷值夜零钱。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_foghorn_5")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	
<<else>>
		铜灯底座还带着余温，转装鲸油时漏斗晃了一下，油滴差点洒在旋转铁梯上。<span class="red">你连忙扶稳油壶收住手，免得台阶沾油打滑。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[拂去表面浮尘再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身沿着原路退回 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Moment Clockwork 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
青铜齿轮回廊的二号从动轮齿槽里卡进了一枚掉落的铜螺母，每次咬合都迸出细碎火星。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回地下机括城 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="reg-mom-clockwork-1">
<<investigateicon>><<link "算准齿轮间隙用长钳夹出 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-clockwork-1">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	铜螺母被顺利取出，齿轮恢复平稳运转，你还捡到了槽底的旧怀表壳。<span class="green">你排除了从动轮的卡齿故障。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_clockwork_1")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺通道继续往里探看 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	齿轮带动铁钳猛晃了一下，震得你手腕生疼。<span class="red">铁钳反震令你虎口发麻。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[听准机括声响再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[退到通风处缓一口气 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "耐着性子拨离合器减速取物 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-clockwork-1">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($maths or 0) gte 250>>
		你先扳动二号从动轮旁的手柄拨开离合器，等齿轮转速降下来后从容夹出了槽底的旧怀表壳。<span class="green">整套减速取物手法稳健利落，齿轮毫发无损。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_clockwork_1")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺通道继续往里探看 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
		离合器手柄沾着一层滑腻机油，你扳动时手掌滑脱了一下，从动轮依旧飞快咬合。<span class="red">你连忙用干布擦净掌心油渍，退开半步重新看准齿位。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[找准借力支点再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身沿着原路退回 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Moment Clockwork 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
蒸汽压力室的副排水槽积了一层温水，水底铸铁格栅下闪着一枚黄铜阀门铭牌的光亮。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回地下机括城 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="reg-mom-clockwork-2">
<<investigateicon>><<link "用铁钩穿过格栅孔勾起铭牌 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-clockwork-2">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	你取出黄铜铭牌与压在下面的几枚检修银币。<span class="green">你从排水槽底捞出了铜铭牌。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_clockwork_2")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺通道继续往里探看 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	温水下突然冒出一串滚烫汽泡，烫得你急忙缩手。<span class="red">热汽泡烫红了你的手背。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[收敛呼吸节奏再试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[退到通风处缓一口气 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
