	樟木伞架边角磕在你的膝盖上，带来一阵酸痛。<span class="red">伞架木棱磕痛了你的膝盖。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[稳住气息重新上手 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Observatory 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺着石阶退回入口处 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "用小刀挑开星盒上铜搭扣 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#reg-mom-observatory-5">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
		你蹲在樟木伞架旁，用随身小刀薄刃贴着星盘木盒的铜搭扣缝隙轻轻一挑，锈死的搭扣应声弹开。<span class="green">盒内的黄道刻度盘与早年社团活动余款完好呈现。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg_moment_observatory_5")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	
<<else>>
		连廊角落光线昏暗，铜搭扣内侧的暗簧卡得很紧，刀尖挑动时擦出一声轻响。<span class="red">眼角有些发涩难辨细处，你决定把木盒挪到窗边光亮处再开。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[换个角度再次尝试 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Observatory 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手退回岔路口 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
